 "takeaways": [
  "Metals: lose electrons → cations (electropositive). Non-metals: gain electrons → anions (electronegative).",
  "Alkali metals are more electropositive than alkaline earth metals.",
  "F is the most electronegative element, then O, N and Cl."
 ],
